  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Women Economic Empowerment (WEE)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims at improving the economic security, stability, and prosperity of women entrepreneurs and women-led MSMEs in Lebanon across selected productive sectors to support their livelihood and wellbeing. The project will address women sub-optimal economic participation through tackling institutional and structural factors that impede their active economic participation, but also inherent gender hierarchies and inequalities.</narrative>
  </description>
